                                "sense_id": "8f329d85-1266-3f39-b32c-3e41ef5d25dd",
                                "text": "Look for patterns – both natural and man-made – and also note the things that break the pattern: the shape of a mound, an odd dog-legged field, or a misshapen window in a line of otherwise standardised cottages."
                            }
